{"a":[10,10],"h":"<p>10.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"212\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 212.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 34.4 54.7 54.7 65.2 65.2 81.0 81.0 87.7 94.4 94.4 110.2 110.2 119.2 119.2 126.0 126.0 132.7 139.4 146.2 158.2 174.0 180.7 187.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.4 132.7 139.4 146.2 180.7 187.4 195.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Siz ve gâvurların gerek Dine ve gerek Dünyaya müteallık hakkında ıhtilâf ettiğiniz her hangi bir şey<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 80.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 32.3 32.3 44.3 44.3 57.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.1 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"57.0 63.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> imdi onun hukmü - o ıhtilâfı kesip atacak huküm<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"95\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 95.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 23.2 30.0 37.4 53.2 64.4 72.0 72.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"64.4 78.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allaha âiddir. - Onu başkası değil o halleder. O cemi' günü haklıyı haksızı o, ayıracak «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"114\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 114.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.8 9.8 16.6 29.3 29.3 36.8 52.6 63.8 63.8 79.6 79.6 90.0 96.8 96.8 104.3\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.8 16.6 104.3\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » ve «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"129\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 129.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 10.6 17.3 17.3 24.0 36.0 43.6 59.3 70.6 70.6 86.3 86.3 96.7 103.6 103.6 111.0 117.7\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"24.0 24.0 111.0 117.7\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » i o yapacaktır. Burası Resulün risâletinden hikâyedir ve yâhud yukarıki «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"54\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 53.5 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.7 16.4 16.4 23.3 35.3 35.3 43.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 23.3 43.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » karînesiyle bir «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"24\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 23.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » emri mukadderdir. Ya'ni de ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"106\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 105.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 37.6 53.3 53.3 62.3 62.3 74.3 74.3 81.8 81.8\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"89.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> işte o hâkim olan Allahdır.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"59\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 59.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.7 27.7 27.7 34.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.4 42.7\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Benim rabbım - malikim, sahibim<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"121\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 120.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 33.0 33.0 39.7 39.7 51.0 59.3 75.0 75.0 81.7 81.7 88.6 95.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.7 51.0 59.3 88.6 95.3 104.3\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ben ona tevekkül etmişim - bütün işlerimde yalnız ona dayanmışımdır.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"115\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 114.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 33.0 39.8 39.8 46.6 46.6 62.3 62.3 69.0 69.0 75.8 83.3 83.3 90.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"75.8 90.0 98.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ve hep ona yüz tutarım - başımın sıkıldığı her müşkil işte ona müreceat eder, ona sığınır ona yalvarırım. 11. </p>"}